  "goodToKnow": "Die Inbetriebnahme is commissioning or putting into operation, a typical word of German officialese and instruction manuals: vor der ersten Inbetriebnahme (before first use). The most famous example: Berlin's BER airport, planned to open in 2011, had its Inbetriebnahme repeatedly postponed until October 2020. Außer Betrieb means out of order. Plural: die Inbetriebnahmen."
